(Country profile: Orvan) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] Orvan is a grain producer with a long coastline and a temperate interior.) Tj
T*
(It grows wheat and maize on a large scale and also produces fertiliser, which is) Tj
T*
(used at home and sold to neighbouring countries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The main exports are wheat, maize and fertiliser. The country imports) Tj
T*
(machinery and medicines. Orvan Grain Port is the principal export facility, with) Tj
T*
(silos, bulk loaders and a separate berth for bagged fertiliser.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] Corvan Grain, a grain exporter, is the best-known firm. The port is) Tj
T*
(connected to the interior by road and a short rail spur, and smaller loading) Tj
T*
(points serve growers in the coastal districts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P4] Grain is stored in silos at the port and at inland collection points.) Tj
T*
(Smaller berths handle bagged fertiliser, and a coastal road links the port to) Tj
T*
(nearby towns.) Tj
